  "body": "## Changelog\n* 5ae0e8e3b6dea279c25278c8f4e701cd3f7bcbb7 Merge pull request #1099 from HanshalDabbiru/patch-1\n* 4b9bee12ad28b00091bce233ce9253536e3d2e16 Update version.txt to 0.7.20\n* 76ecb5adc5406b2243cda1a02b00a6217ec3efb0 Merge pull request #1097 from HanshalDabbiru/ec2-metrics\n* b9e03e9accb8ad741201595876214cb56ab124be removed hardcoded response code for ec2_total_responses metric\n* 26f1f09d1c00715dd9455d29ce99907da35b135d added unit tests for ec2 connection metrics\n* 9a67ed01e45e5dd837980e4ef40f889a9d1992ef added ec2 metrics: ec2_responses_total and ec2_connection_failures_total\n\n"
